<title>USA: BankAmerica Corp sells $300 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica Corp sells $300 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from BankAmerica Corp was priced on Thursday, according to co-lead manager BA Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANKAMERICA CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 3/1/2009</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.851  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.144 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 56 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
